{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-seasidestory",
  "id": "source-31701",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "31701001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "噢——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "好强烈的阳光……这个世界是何等的美好……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "现在的我真幸福，感觉要升天了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "不，我已经在天堂了……要融化了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "喂，需要我帮你上点清凉涂料吗？暴晒对皮肤可不好哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔……继续光合作用……呼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……已经舒服得睡着了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "算了，海边的景色确实让人心情很畅快。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "啧，你们也在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "哎呀，明明是来度假的，就不要愁眉苦脸了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你手上拿着的……是排球，对吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我说是的话，又会怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "只有一个人可是打不了沙滩排球的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我听出来你的意思了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "你在挑衅我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "去旁边的场地上干一场吧。你先发球？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我可以接受你的挑战，但无论怎样结果都不会改变。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "你将迎来体无完肤的惨败。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "不一定哦，沙滩排球是热情与活力的比拼——比热情的话我可不会输。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "盲目自信的后果，就是堕入暗不见底的深渊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "已经到了放狠话的环节了吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "咳咳，那就让你见识一下传说中的——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701024",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "夏季大三角螺旋扣球吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31701025",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "热烈的日光与隐约的潮声，见证着这场即将上演的沙滩热斗。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
